      "content": "that makes sense. so if i'm writing this, should i frame the hesitation of some staff as a legitimate disagreement on values, or is it better to present it more as a learning curve that the company needs to help them overcome? like, is the resistance itself a core part of the debate or just a temporary hurdle?",
