    "summary": "The user asks for guidance on drafting an HR memo regarding gender-neutral pronouns, specifically seeking help on how to frame opposing viewpoints. The assistant provides a balanced overview of pros and cons and subsequently advises the user on how to incorporate resistance into the memo by framing it as both a valid perspective and a societal shift toward inclusivity.",
    "scores": {
